<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Steel Dynamics restared.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Steel Dynamics restared.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc said it restarted coverage of Steel Dynamics Inc on Friday with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/16 to 25-1/16.</p>
</text>
